{"content": "The release codename mentioned in the comment is **AZURE-LANTERN-8090**.\n\nThe first class defined in the excerpt, `Message`, serves as the basic object for representing email messages within the Python `email` package. It manages RFC 2822 headers and a payload (which can be a string or a list of sub-messages), providing methods to access, modify, and serialize the message content.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.2089506904918288, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.2089506904918288}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -2.341608695252571}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -2.523676566346321}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -5.233017615540657}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -5.487595252259407}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -6.272728614075813}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -8.355339698060188}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -9.311737708314094}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -9.3937460701305}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -9.551321677430305}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.173771552308235}, {"token": "3", "logprob": -10.466908148987923}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -10.674750022156868}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -10.839912108643684}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -10.883539847596321}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -11.062617949708137}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -11.244730643494758}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -11.314354590638313}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -11.36707370684925}, {"token": "release", "logprob": -11.386188201172981}]}, {"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00010793759299687622, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00010793759299687622}, {"token": " first", "logprob": -9.284272366303934}, {"token": " mention", "logprob": -13.574429684419169}, {"token": " specific", "logprob": -13.826253109712138}, {"token": " code", "logprob": -13.913333111543192}, {"token": " comment", "logprob": -13.945708447236552}, {"token": " second", "logprob": -14.10688131405784}, {"token": " released", "logprob": -14.24473684384